  "description": "Ever since she married rich hottie Seo Moon-hyuk, people began to call Jo Eunae the “Cinderella of the 21st Century.” But Eunae’s life is no fairy tale, and her marriage…well, it’s barely even real! Imagine still being a virgin after three years of marriage! Desperate to live the life she’s always wanted, Eunae asks for a divorce on the anniversary of their 1000th day of marriage. Except, suddenly her oh-so-sexy husband seems interested in her for the first time! He’s putting in more effort than ever before, but why now…?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
